{"minVersion":"0.1","headerImage":"https://qnblackcat.github.io/repo/assets/com.qn.callguard_iphoneos-arm64/banner.png","tintColor":"","tabs":[{"tabname":"Details","views":[{"class":"HiddenDepictionScreenshotsView","screenshots":[],"itemCornerRadius":8,"itemSize":false},{"markdown":"# CallGuard\n\nSilently block incoming SIM calls by number prefix (e.g. `0285671`), so a whole range is covered without listing each number.\n\n- Add the prefixes you want to block in Settings \u2192 CallGuard. A prefix needs at least 3 digits, with no upper length limit.\n- `+84\u2026` and `84\u2026` are normalized to `0\u2026` before matching.\n- Numbers in Contacts are always let through (can be turned off with \"Block contacts too\").\n- Numbers you have called before (in Recents) are also let through (can be turned off).\n","useSpacing":"true","class":"DepictionMarkdownView"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionHeaderView","title":"Information"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Developer","text":"Qn"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Version","text":"1.0.0"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Compatibility","text":"iOS 15.0 or later"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Section","text":"Tweaks"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"View Source Code","action":"https://github.com/qnblackcat/CallGuard","openExternal":"true","tintColor":""},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"Contact Support","action":"depiction-https://qnblackcat.github.io/repo/depiction/native/help/com.qn.callguard_iphoneos-arm64.json","openExternal":"true","tintColor":""},{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"Made with \u2764\ufe0f by Qn \u00b7 Powered by Silica","textColor":"#999999","fontSize":"10.0","alignment":1}],"class":"DepictionStackView"},{"tabname":"Changelog","views":[{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"#### Version 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release."},{"class":"DepictionLabe